==Spanish==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|es}} {{term|apparescere|appārēscēre||lang=la}}, present active infinitive of {{term|apparesco|appārēscō|begin to appear|lang=la}}, from {{term|appareo|appareō|lang=la}}.

===Verb===
{{es-verb|aparec|er|pres=aparezco}}

# to [[appear]]; to [[turn up]]
#: '''''apareció''' de la nada''
#:: ''it '''came out''' of nowhere''

====Conjugation====
{{es-conj-er (c-zc)|apare}}

